GENERAL OBJECTIVES
On completion of this Section, students should:
1. understand the importance of managing resources effectively to achieve family and
individual goals;
2. develop the ability to effectively manage time and money towards the achievement of
individual and family goals;
3. understand work simplification strategies;
4. understand the relationship between effective time and money management and stress
prevention;
5. appreciate the time and money management practices of individuals and families.
