6. discuss factors that affect work simplification;
7. demonstrate work simplification strategies;
8. develop a daily time management plan for different groups of persons;
9. analyse various consequences of ineffective time management;
10. explain terms associated with money management;
11. discuss the functions of money;
12. describe the means by which money is earned;
13. explain the principles of money management;
SECTION 3: MANAGING FAMILY RESOURCES (cont’d)
