15. explain the reasons for preparing a budget;
16. outline factors to be considered in preparing a budget;
17. prepare a budget;
18. formulate guidelines for effective management of time by individuals and the family;
19. formulate guidelines for effective management of money by individuals and the family;
20. evaluate the time and money management practices of individuals and families.
CONTENT
